---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy & Travel Enquiries"
  description="How the Trip Andaman website handles enquiry details, local interactions and links to external services."
>
  <PageHero
    title="Privacy & Enquiries"
    eyebrow="CLEAR INFORMATION"
    description="A practical explanation of how this website’s enquiry tools work."
    image="north-bay"
    alt="North Bay lighthouse among tropical trees"
  />
  <section class="section">
    <div class="legal-layout prose">
      <h2>
        How Enquiries <span class="accent">Work</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        You can contact TRIP ANDAMAN by phone ({site.phone}) or WhatsApp. The
        enquiry form on this website asks for your name, mobile number, optional
        travel date, number of travellers and interests, and a message. Please
        share only what is needed to discuss your holiday — no passport, payment
        or other sensitive details.
      </p>
      <p>
        The form does not send your details to this website, a database or any
        other service. When you press “Open WhatsApp with my enquiry”, your
        browser turns the details into a WhatsApp message addressed to TRIP
        ANDAMAN and opens WhatsApp. At that point you are transferred to
        WhatsApp, a service operated by Meta Platforms under its own terms and
        privacy policy. Nothing is sent until you choose to press Send inside
        WhatsApp, and you can edit or discard the message first.
      </p>
      <p>
        If you do send it, TRIP ANDAMAN receives your message and WhatsApp
        number in its WhatsApp account and uses them to reply to your travel
        enquiry.
      </p>
      <h2>
        Website <span class="accent">Storage</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        This website does not use analytics, advertising or tracking cookies,
        and it does not save form entries in your browser. Form fields and
        gallery controls work locally in your browser.
      </p>
      <p>
        The website is hosted on Vercel, which processes technical request
        information (such as IP address and browser type) to deliver and protect
        the site, under its own terms.
      </p>
      <h2>
        External <span class="accent">Links</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        Phone links open your phone app. WhatsApp links open WhatsApp. Map links
        open Google Maps. Destination references and photo-credit links lead to
        third-party websites with their own privacy practices.
      </p>
      <h2>
        Questions About <span class="accent">Your Information?</span>
      </h2>
      <p>
        Call <a href={`tel:${site.tel}`}>{site.phone}</a> or{' '}
        <a href={site.whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          message us on WhatsApp
        </a>{' '}
        to ask about information you have shared with us.
      </p>
      <p>
        This page describes how the website currently works. For business
        data-handling terms, please contact TRIP ANDAMAN.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
